{"ID":"20240724161149-16d154b","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240724161149-16d154b","title":"莲子心","type":"doc","updated":"20240902170151"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240724161158-yozeo2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161158-yozeo2k","updated":"20240724161158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"莲子心"}]},{"ID":"20240724161158-qzwpgom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161158-qzwpgom","updated":"20240724161158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产湖南、湖北、福建、江苏、浙江、江西等地。\n【性状】\t本品略呈细棒状，长1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.4cm，直径约0.2cm。幼叶绿色，一长一短，卷成箭形，先端向下反折，两幼叶间可见细小胚芽。胚根圆柱形，长约3mm，黄白色。质脆，易折断，断面有数个小孔。气微，味苦。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清心安神，交通心肾，涩精止血。用于热入心包，神昏谵语，心肾不交，失眠遗精，血热吐血。"}]},{"ID":"20240724183843-jzk37ed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724183843-jzk37ed","updated":"20240724183843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206100953-yx4hkba.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161158-yfto0vq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161158-yfto0vq","updated":"20240724161158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101039-ovwckzb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161324-1dvx74n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161324-1dvx74n","updated":"20240724161324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 649px;","style":"width: 639px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莲子心"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莲子心-20240724161324-04ccfjm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 639px;\" parent-style=\"width: 649px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161344-ntk30ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161344-ntk30ca","updated":"20240724161344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 653px;","style":"width: 643px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莲子心 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莲子心 1-20240724161344-nn5i3me.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 643px;\" parent-style=\"width: 653px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161447-p9ovih3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161447-p9ovih3","updated":"20240724161447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240724160926-oubnbhh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161447-6xkgc7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161447-6xkgc7q","updated":"20240724161447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621115618-6nq1xik.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 443px;","style":"width: 433px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621115625-x18qwzp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 433px;\" parent-style=\"width: 443px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 346px;","style":"width: 336px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621124313-1g6qc7s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 336px;\" parent-style=\"width: 346px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161447-cutpw6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161447-cutpw6t","updated":"20240724161447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 375px;","style":"width: 365px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荷花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荷花-20240724155143-k61v7x3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 365px;\" parent-style=\"width: 375px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荷花 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOp